1
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:02,840
Let's go.

2
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:09,199
Come on.

3
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:11,400
Wait.

4
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:25,840
We are being followed.

5
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:41,760
Sir, ma'am,

6
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:42,560
Where to?

7
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:44,780
We are not going anywhere.

8
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:46,920
This car is yours.

9
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:48,480
Let's go.

10
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,760
This car is mine.

11
00:02:53,079 --> 00:02:54,079
Unbelievable.

12
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,500
Where on earth did they go?

13
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,580
I really don't know, boss.

14
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:35,720
I don't know.

15
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,600
Boss, I really don't know.

16
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:52,600
We found them.

17
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,200
Get lost.

18
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:42,200
Pei Song.

19
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,160
Hello,

20
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:19,200
Grandpa.

21
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,640
Pei Song,

22
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,600
what have you been busy with lately?

23
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:25,800
As the saying goes,

24
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,760
there are three forms of unfilial conduct,

25
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,200
and having no descendants is the worst.

26
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,520
You are already thirty,

27
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:31,920
but you still haven't settled down.

28
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:34,380
The family has placed such high hopes on you.

29
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,410
I'm telling you,

30
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,400
this blind date,

31
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,170
you must go today

32
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,440
no matter what.

33
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,080
Grandpa,

34
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,680
I've told you so many times.

35
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:52,920
I'm not going.

36
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,850
I have no interest in marriage.

37
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,080
Hello?

38
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,050
Pei Song.

39
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:00,440
Okay.

40
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,520
I'll go right now.

41
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:07,440
This boy

42
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,520
is quite obedient today.

43
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:10,960
Peining.

44
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,480
You should learn from your brother.

45
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:15,120
After your brother has a child,

46
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,280
it will be your turn.

47
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,360
Grandpa.

48
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,120
Actually,

49
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,960
I don't want to use social apps

50
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,890
or go on blind dates to get married.

51
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:31,360
Do you have someone you like?

52
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:34,760
Not really.

53
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:36,520
I want

54
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,620
to marry my significant other

55
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:40,800
because we truly love each other,

56
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:42,800
not for any other reason.

57
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:45,600
Your thought

58
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:46,960
is not unreasonable.

59
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,160
But Peining,

60
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:50,920
let me tell you,

61
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,640
marriage

62
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,000
is not as simple as you think.

63
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:56,960
Look at your brother.

64
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:58,880
He's busy with work all day.

65
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:00,600
How does he have time to date?

66
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:02,160
I don't care if your brother

67
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:03,840
finds someone through a blind date

68
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,960
or finds someone himself in the future.

69
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:06,720
Anyway,

70
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:10,360
I want to see my granddaughter-in-law walk through the door today.

71
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:10,840
Okay.

72
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:11,370
Grandpa,

73
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:12,720
have some tea.

74
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:43,560
Are you

75
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,480
Song Shiya?
